INC-20877 is resolved.

Root cause: /srv/wal on bkp-01 was not mounted after the reboot of 4 Oct, so every WAL archive attempt from db-prd-02 failed from 5 Oct 01:02 and pg_wal grew until the volume was full. The CRITICAL alert at 03:12 on 6 Oct was not acted on.
Fix: /srv/wal mounted (fstab corrected); archiving caught up overnight.
Follow-up: incident review on 21 Oct.

